        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umuryano wabaye i Lebanoni uzokwubikizako, n’ukugesera kw’ibikōko kuzogutera ubgoba, uhōwe amaraso y’ abantu, n’umuryano igihugu cabonye, bo n’ibisagara n’ababibamwo bose.",
